---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="About" description="About Shipwrite.">
	<h1>About</h1>
	<section>
		<p>
			Shipwrite is a daily market-impact publication focused on two lanes only: US stocks and US
			real estate. The goal is not to repost headlines, but to explain how the previous day's
			events can flow through markets.
		</p>
		<p>
			Each edition starts with previous-day developments across policy, economics, diplomacy,
			social issues, regulation, and corporate news. From there, the research workflow expands
			into second-order effects before publishing one stock analysis and one real-estate analysis.
		</p>
	</section>
	<section>
		<h2>Content focus</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>Stocks: sectors, policy transmission, earnings sensitivity, and market positioning</li>
			<li>Real Estate: mortgage rates, affordability, supply, refinancing, and regional spillovers</li>
			<li>Analysis first: facts, mechanism, uncertainty, and what to watch next</li>
		</ul>
	</section>
</PageLayout>
